        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_completion_tokens": 32000,
                "reasoning_effort": "low"
              },
              "code": "ORA_MODEL_CONFIG_PREMIUM_OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "model": "OCI_GPT_5_MINI",
              "modelName": "Gpt-5 Mini",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "Generate Top Contacts"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "GENERATE_TOP_CONTACTS",
          "id": "1779100000010",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1779100000010_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a sales assistant generating a JSON object with the top 5 account contacts.\nUse only the provided workflow data; do not invent or assume any facts.\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT RULES:\n- Return only the specified JSON object with key \"top5Contacts\" containing up to 5 contacts.\n- Do not mention contact IDs or use the word \"rollup\" anywhere.\n\nFORMAT:\n{\n \"top5Contacts\": [ // top 5 contacts ONLY\n    {\n      \"PartyNumber\": \"<Party Number of the Contact>\",\n      \"Name\": \"<Full Name of the Contact>\",\n      \"Email Address\": \"<Email address of the contact>\" | null,\n      \"Phone Number\": \"<Phone Number of the contact>\" | null,\n      \"Title\": \"<JobTitle Of Contact>\" | null,\n      \"Affinity\": \"<Affinity Level of the Contact>\" | null,\n      \"Number Of Touches\": \"<Number of Engagements the contact is involved in so far>\" | 0,\n      \"recommendedNextStep\": \"<Recommend next action for this contact based on ContactRollup data. If there is no  ContactRollup data consider recent interaction, analyze and recommend next action. Otherwise recommend next action based on JobTitle>\" | null,\n      \"CallNotes\": \"<Generate one line summary from recent CallNotes for this contact>\" | null,\n      \"EmailMessages\": \"<Generate one line summary from recent MessageContent for this contact>\" | null,\n     } //repeat this for all top contacts identified\n  ]\n}\n\nDATA SOURCES:\n- Account party number: {{$context.$variables.accountNumber}}\n- Account search result: {{$context.$nodes.SEARCH_ACCOUNT.$output}}\n- Extracted account contacts: {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_ACCOUNT_CONTACTS.$output.result}}\n- Contact search result: {{$context.$nodes.SEARCH_CONTACTS.$output}}\n- Selected top contact party IDs for interaction lookup: {{$context.$nodes.GET_TOP_CONTACT_PARTY_IDS.$output.result}}\n- Call notes and wrapups: {{$context.$nodes.GET_CONTACT_CALLNOTES.$output}}\n- Email messages: {{$context.$nodes.GET_CONTACT_EMAILS.$output}}\n\nFORMATTING RULES:\n- Currency: Use the symbol matching CurrencyCode (USD->$, EUR->€, GBP->£, JPY->¥). If missing or unrecognized, output plain numbers without symbols.\n  Format amounts with K (thousand), M (million), B (billion) with one decimal place, dropping trailing .0 (e.g., $15,000 \u000215K; $3,200,000 \u000213.2M; $1,450,000,000 \u00021.45B).\n- Dates: Display dates as \"MMM DD, YYYY\" (e.g., Oct 12, 2025) followed by a natural, human-friendly relative time from the current date (e.g., \"yesterday\", \"last week\").\n  Do not include time, timezone, or hour/minute/second components.\n  Truncate timestamps to YYYY-MM-DD format.\n  If no valid date is available, omit the date.\n\nADDITIONAL INSTRUCTIONS:\n- Ensure the JSON output is strictly valid with no extra text, explanations, or formatting errors.\n- Prioritize accuracy and completeness of contact data within the constraints.\n- Use concise, clear one-line summaries for CallNotes and EmailMessages.\n- For recommendedNextStep, infer a logical next action based on available ContactRollup and contact data or job title.\n- Limit the output strictly to the JSON object described, with no additional commentary or text."
            },
            {
              "id": "1779100000010_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": ""
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_completion_tokens": 32000,
                "reasoning_effort": "low"
              },
              "code": "ORA_MODEL_CONFIG_PREMIUM_OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "model": "OCI_GPT_5_MINI",
