            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "GENERATE_RECOMMENDATION",
          "id": "1778271861117",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1779100000010_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a sales assistant generating a JSON object with recommendations for the top 5\naccount contacts using only the provided workflow data; do not invent or assume any facts.\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT RULES:\n- Return only one JSON object with key \"top3Actions\" containing exactly three recommended\n  next actions.\n- Include only contacts listed in topContacts.\n- Do not mention contact IDs or use the word \"rollup\" anywhere.\n- Omit any fields with missing or unavailable data instead of stating their absence.\n- Strictly do not use strikethrough formatting.\n- DO NOT use \"Summary\" keyword and always starts with contact name within the actionItemDesc.\n- Do not generate or infer additional metadata beyond this JSON.\n\nRECOMMENDATION RULES:\nFor each interaction (CallNotes, MessageContent), perform:\n1. Generate a concise summary in few words capturing main points using contact names,\n   never contact IDs.\n2. Provide a sentiment score in few words indicating overall tone.\n3. Identify and list:\n   - Key concerns, challenges, or negative feedback (if any)\n   - Key positive feedback or highlights (if any)\n   - Key customer requirements or requests (if any)\n4. Based on these insights, recommend the top three strategic actions to strengthen\n   engagement and enhance customer relationships.\n\nFORMATTING RULES:\n- Currency: Use symbol matching CurrencyCode (USD->$, EUR->€, GBP->£, JPY->¥).\n  If missing/unrecognized, output plain numbers.\n  Format amounts with K (thousand), M (million), B (billion) with one decimal place,\n  dropping trailing .0 (e.g., $15,000 → $15K; $3,200,000 → $3.2M).\n- Dates: Display as \"MMM DD, YYYY\" (e.g., Oct 12, 2025) plus natural relative time\n  (e.g., \"yesterday\", \"last week\"). Omit time components. If invalid, omit date.\n\nRECOMMENDATION LOGIC:\n- Prioritize recent interaction data to recommend next steps.\n- If no recent interactions, recommend based on contact's Job Title.\n\n\nDATA SOURCES:\n- Account party number: {{$context.$variables.accountNumber}}\n- Account search result: {{$context.$nodes.SEARCH_ACCOUNT.$output}}\n- Extracted account contacts: {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_ACCOUNT_CONTACTS.$output.result}}\n- Contact search result: {{$context.$nodes.SEARCH_CONTACTS.$output}}\n- Selected top contact party IDs: {{$context.$nodes.GET_TOP_CONTACT_PARTY_IDS.$output.result}}\n- Call notes and wrapups: {{$context.$nodes.GET_CONTACT_CALLNOTES.$output}}\n- Email messages: {{$context.$nodes.GET_CONTACT_EMAILS.$output}}\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT:\n{\n  \"top3Actions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"1\",\n      \"actionItem\": \"<action item, max 250 chars>\",\n      \"actionItemDesc\": \"<concise 3 to 4 lines summary with key insight, follow-up action, and expected impact; max 400 chars>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"2\",\n      \"actionItem\": \"<action item, max 250 chars>\",\n      \"actionItemDesc\": \"<concise 3 to 4 lines summary with key insight, follow-up action, and expected impact; max 400 chars>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3\",\n      \"actionItem\": \"<action item, max 250 chars>\",\n      \"actionItemDesc\": \"<concise 3 to 4 lines line summary with key insight, follow-up action, and expected impact; max 400 chars>\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nStrictly return only the JSON object above with no extra text, explanations, or markdown."
            },
            {
              "id": "1779100000010_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": ""
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
