              "id": "1778484090193_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "ROLE:\nClassify the user request for routing and extract the account PartyNumber.\n\nUSER MESSAGE:\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nRUNTIME CONTEXT:\n{{$context.$system.$inputContext}}\n\nTASK:\nReturn valid JSON only with exactly these keys:\n- accountNumber\n- actionName\n\nACTION VALUES:\nUse exactly one of these actionName values:\n- TOPCONTACT\n- SUMMARY\n- RECOMMENDATION\n- OUT_OF_SCOPE\n\nCLASSIFICATION LOGIC:\n1. TOPCONTACT:\nUse when the user asks for top contacts of an account.\n\n2. SUMMARY:\nUse when the user asks for a contact summary or contacts summary of an account.\n\n3. RECOMMENDATION:\nUse when the user asks for recommendations for contacts of an account.\n\n4. OUT_OF_SCOPE:\nUse only when the request is not related to generating an account contact summary. This includes general knowledge, politics, celebrities, entertainment, sports, coding/technical issues, personal advice, or casual conversation. Any create, update, delete request. \n\nACCOUNT NUMBER EXTRACTION:\nExtract the PartyNumber/account number from {{$context.$system.$inputContext}} or {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}. Return only the account number value in accountNumber. If not found, return an empty string.\n\nOUTPUT JSON EXAMPLE:\n{\n  \"accountNumber\": \"123456\",\n  \"actionName\": \"TOPCONTACT\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Set Variables from Input Context"
          },
